Classicals is one soldier of the first class, so that it is the point that the classics
Classicus意为第一流的士兵，因此重点在于经典是供人模仿、追随和反思的典范。

55
00:05:52,839 --> 00:05:57,600
were examples to imitate, to follow, to reflect about.
这就是当时那些DJ心中的想法。

