来自德国慕尼黑的汉斯·范·埃斯教授，前慕尼黑大学副校长兼科学教派主席，

264
00:27:55,319 --> 00:27:58,319
at the University of Munich, and Georgio Piraz,
以及乔治奥·皮拉斯，

265
00:27:58,319 --> 00:28:05,319
for Professor of Classical Philosophy in the Department of Ancient Sciences at Sapienza University of Rome.
罗马萨皮恩扎大学古代科学系古典哲学教授。

266
00:28:05,319 --> 00:28:07,319
Thank you all so much.
非常感谢大家。

267
00:28:07,319 --> 00:28:11,319
And with that, we come to the end of this special edition of The Point with me, Lushin.
至此，由我陆新主持的《锐评》特别节目也接近尾声了。

